{"id":762,"date":"2012-05-07T16:41:48","date_gmt":"2012-05-07T16:41:48","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=762"},"modified":"2015-04-24T23:22:39","modified_gmt":"2015-04-24T22:22:39","slug":"festival-de-robotique-epfl-2012","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2012\/05\/07\/festival-de-robotique-epfl-2012\/","title":{"rendered":"Festival de robotique EPFL 2012"},"content":{"rendered":"<figure id=\"attachment_763\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-763\" style=\"width: 300px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2012\/05\/festival12.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-763\" title=\"festival12\" src=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2012\/05\/festival12-300x294.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"294\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2012\/05\/festival12-300x294.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2012\/05\/festival12.png 500w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-763\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Les petits comme les grands avaient des discussions \u00e0 partager<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Comme \u00e0 l\u2019accoutum\u00e9e, le Microclub a particip\u00e9 \u00e0 l&rsquo;\u00e9dition 2012 du festival de robotique de l&rsquo;EPFL\u00a0!<\/p>\n<p>Comme pour les jeux de soci\u00e9t\u00e9, nous avons expos\u00e9 sur notre stand, divers bricolages pour les passionn\u00e9s de 6 \u00e0 66 ans\u00a0!<\/p>\n<p>Une attrape souris et <a title=\"Hugo l'Asticot\" href=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=HcOrRL81now\" target=\"_blank\">Hugo l&rsquo;asticot<\/a> pour les plus jeunes, des commandes de chauffages avec Arduino, divers m\u00e9canismes, une t\u00e9l\u00e9commande par t\u00e9l\u00e9phone portable et une commande de cloche d&rsquo;\u00e9glise pour les plus grands\u00a0!<\/p>\n<p>Plusieurs membres ont particip\u00e9 \u00e0 la r\u00e9ussite de notre stand, et surtout nous avons r\u00e9ussi \u00e0 faire sourire tous les enfants qui sont la rel\u00e8ve de demain\u00a0!<\/p>\n<p>Merci \u00e0 Tous<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Comme \u00e0 l\u2019accoutum\u00e9e, le Microclub a particip\u00e9 \u00e0 l&rsquo;\u00e9dition 2012 du festival de robotique de l&rsquo;EPFL\u00a0! Comme pour les jeux<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[166],"tags":[1],"class_list":["post-762","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-microclub","tag-non-classe"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/762","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/4"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=762"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/762\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":765,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/762\/revisions\/765"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=762"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=762"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=762"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}